    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d958">

                <pb facs="1104" n="1008" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1008"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-11"><hi rendition="#italic">February 11,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Dispatch concerning Spanish minister received. Have seen Spanish minister for
                    foreign affairs. Resignation of Spanish minister had <pb facs="1105" n="1009"
                        xml:id="pg1009"/> been asked and accepted by cable before our interview. The
                    first secretary of legation at Washington will be placed at once in charge of
                    the legation. New minister will be appointed at once, and will reach Washington
                    in about 15 days. Full report by next mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
